---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../config';
---
<Base>
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="role" data-reveal>Senior Manager, Platform Reliability &amp; Operations</p>
        <h1 id="hero-title" data-reveal>Complex systems.<br /><span>Clearer outcomes.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-lead" data-reveal>For 25+ years, I've worked across the systems behind critical technology &mdash; from infrastructure and datacenters to Azure platforms and AI-enabled operations.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="topology" aria-label="A systems topology resolving many inputs into one clear signal">
        <div class="topology-labels" aria-hidden="true"><span>Complexity</span><span>Clarity</span></div>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 720 560" role="img" aria-label="Interconnected infrastructure nodes converging into an operational signal">
          <g class="grid" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1">
            <path d="M28 70H692M28 178H692M28 286H692M28 394H692M28 502H692" />
            <path d="M84 36V524M196 36V524M308 36V524M420 36V524M532 36V524M644 36V524" />
          </g>
          <g class="mesh" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2">
            <path d="M46 92L142 58 220 132 108 190 46 92Z" /><path d="M142 58L286 84 220 132" /><path d="M108 190L220 132 284 220 158 276 108 190Z" />
            <path d="M42 326L158 276 228 362 106 438 42 326Z" /><path d="M158 276L284 220 340 322 228 362" /><path d="M106 438L228 362 288 494" />
            <path d="M286 84L394 158 284 220" /><path d="M284 220L394 158 430 286 340 322Z" /><path d="M340 322L430 286 456 402 288 494" />
          </g>
          <g class="nodes">
            <circle cx="46" cy="92" r="4"/><circle cx="142" cy="58" r="4"/><circle cx="220" cy="132" r="4"/><circle cx="108" cy="190" r="4"/><circle cx="286" cy="84" r="4"/><circle cx="284" cy="220" r="4"/><circle cx="158" cy="276" r="4"/><circle cx="42" cy="326" r="4"/><circle cx="228" cy="362" r="4"/><circle cx="106" cy="438" r="4"/><circle cx="288" cy="494" r="4"/><circle cx="394" cy="158" r="4"/><circle cx="430" cy="286" r="4"/><circle cx="340" cy="322" r="4"/><circle cx="456" cy="402" r="4"/>
          </g>
          <g class="signals" fill="none" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M46 92L220 132 284 220 430 286 520 286 586 286" />
            <path d="M42 326L158 276 340 322 430 286 520 286 586 286" />
            <path d="M106 438L228 362 456 402 520 286 586 286" />
          </g>
          <circle class="signal-node" cx="586" cy="286" r="7" />
          <path class="resolved" d="M586 286H682" fill="none" stroke-width="2" />
          <circle class="end-node" cx="682" cy="286" r="4" />
          <text x="596" y="262">operational signal</text>
        </svg>
        <p>Many inputs. One useful direction.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <dl class="proof-strip" aria-label="Career evidence">
      <div><dt>25+</dt><dd>Years across technology and infrastructure</dd></div>
      <div><dt>15</dt><dd>Years at Microsoft</dd></div>
      <div><dt>$1M+</dt><dd>Annual platform savings delivered</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </section>

  <section class="through-line dark-section" aria-labelledby="through-title">
    <div class="chapter-label" data-reveal><span>Career system</span><span>1998 &mdash; Today</span></div>
    <div class="through-intro" data-reveal>
      <p>One continuous operating system.</p>
      <h2 id="through-title">Each layer built on the one before it.</h2>
      <div><p>The work changed as technology changed. The operating questions did not: how does the system behave, where does it fail, and what would make it easier to run?</p><p>That foundation is why AI is a continuation of the career story, not a sudden reinvention.</p></div>
    </div>
    <ol class="system-evolution" aria-label="Technology career progression">
      <li data-reveal><span>01</span><strong>Infrastructure</strong><small>Understand the machine</small></li>
      <li data-reveal><span>02</span><strong>Datacenters</strong><small>Operate with consequence</small></li>
      <li data-reveal><span>03</span><strong>Cloud</strong><small>Design for scale</small></li>
      <li data-reveal><span>04</span><strong>Platform operations</strong><small>Connect the system</small></li>
      <li data-reveal><span>05</span><strong>AI-enabled operations</strong><small>Improve the signal</small></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section id="impact" class="impact" aria-labelledby="impact-title">
    <div class="impact-heading" data-reveal>
      <p class="section-tag"><span>01</span> Impact</p>
      <h2 id="impact-title">Evidence belongs close to the work.</h2>
      <p>Four examples of what changed, how I approached it, and why it mattered.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="impact-list">
      <article data-reveal>
        <div class="impact-name"><span>Cost</span><strong>$1M+</strong></div>
        <dl><div><dt>What changed</dt><dd>Annual Azure data-platform spend was reduced.</dd></div><div><dt>Approach</dt><dd>Right-size capacity, improve reservation strategy, and remove idle infrastructure.</dd></div><div><dt>Why it mattered</dt><dd>Cost became an engineering signal with owners, not a late finance surprise.</dd></div></dl>
      </article>
      <article data-reveal>
        <div class="impact-name"><span>Reliability</span><strong>Test before scale</strong></div>
        <dl><div><dt>What changed</dt><dd>Infrastructure changes gained a controlled place to fail first.</dd></div><div><dt>Approach</dt><dd>Established the first Azure datacenter instrumentation and pre-production lab.</dd></div><div><dt>Why it mattered</dt><dd>Teams could learn before broad rollout carried the uncertainty.</dd></div></dl>
      </article>
      <article data-reveal>
        <div class="impact-name"><span>Operational excellence</span><strong>Readiness by design</strong></div>
        <dl><div><dt>What changed</dt><dd>Monitoring, incident response, and runbooks moved earlier into delivery.</dd></div><div><dt>Approach</dt><dd>Make operational readiness part of preparation, review, and ownership.</dd></div><div><dt>Why it mattered</dt><dd>Critical data-platform change became more predictable and accountable.</dd></div></dl>
      </article>
      <article data-reveal>
        <div class="impact-name"><span>Modernization</span><strong>Connected decisions</strong></div>
        <dl><div><dt>What changed</dt><dd>Capacity, finance, and supply-chain decisions shared a clearer system view.</dd></div><div><dt>Approach</dt><dd>Use automation, measurement, and continuous-improvement methods to expose friction.</dd></div><div><dt>Why it mattered</dt><dd>Operational and cost risk became visible sooner.</dd></div></dl>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="about" class="experience dark-section" aria-labelledby="experience-title">
    <div class="experience-intro" data-reveal>
      <p class="section-tag"><span>02</span> Experience</p>
      <h2 id="experience-title">A career measured in changing systems.</h2>
      <a href="/experience">Full experience <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
    </div>
    <ol class="career-track" aria-label="Selected career progression">
      <li data-reveal><time>1998</time><div><strong>Infrastructure foundations</strong><span>Servers, networks, operating systems</span></div></li>
      <li data-reveal><time>2005</time><div><strong>Service delivery &amp; datacenter operations</strong><span>Availability, incidents, customer consequence</span></div></li>
      <li data-reveal><time>2011</time><div><strong>Microsoft</strong><span>Datacenter strategy, reliability, automation</span></div></li>
      <li data-reveal><time>2020</time><div><strong>Cloud operations &amp; continuous improvement</strong><span>Capacity, cost, operational systems</span></div></li>
      <li data-reveal><time>2022</time><div><strong>Data-platform reliability &amp; operations</strong><span>Business-critical Azure platforms</span></div></li>
      <li data-reveal><time>Today</time><div><strong>AI-enabled operations &amp; product building</strong><span>Decision support grounded in real work</span></div></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section id="intelligence" class="ai dark-section" aria-labelledby="ai-title">
    <div class="ai-intro" data-reveal>
      <p class="section-tag"><span>03</span> AI &amp; operations</p>
      <div><h2 id="ai-title">Operations first.<br />AI where it helps.</h2><p>I understand operations deeply enough to know where AI is actually useful: improving signal, reducing repetitive work, and supporting decisions without hiding the evidence.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-matrix">
      <article data-reveal><span>01</span><h3>Incident intelligence</h3><p>Patterns and likely cause areas, surfaced sooner.</p></article>
      <article data-reveal><span>02</span><h3>Knowledge systems</h3><p>Operational context made searchable and grounded.</p></article>
      <article data-reveal><span>03</span><h3>Decision support</h3><p>Context-aware assistance connected to real workflows.</p></article>
      <article data-reveal><span>04</span><h3>Cost intelligence</h3><p>Forecasting, anomaly detection, and earlier visibility.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="built" class="built dark-section" aria-labelledby="built-title">
    <div class="built-heading" data-reveal><p class="section-tag"><span>04</span> Built</p><div><p>Ideas made real</p><h2 id="built-title">Still close to the work.</h2><p>Products are where systems thinking meets consequence: real inputs, real constraints, and a person making the final decision.</p></div></div>

    <article class="lifelens-product" data-reveal>
      <div class="phone-surface"><span>Live Android product</span><img src="/lifelens/screen-1.png" alt="LifeLens Android home screen showing a private photo library" width="1080" height="2160" loading="eager" decoding="async" /></div>
      <div class="product-story">
        <div class="product-title"><img src="/lifelens/icon.png" alt="" width="64" height="64" /><h3>LifeLens</h3></div>
        <p class="product-tagline">Your photos, understood.</p>
        <dl><div><dt>The problem</dt><dd>Photo libraries grow faster than people can understand or safely clean them.</dd></div><div><dt>What I built</dt><dd>Private, on-device intelligence that turns clutter into reviewable decisions.</dd></div><div><dt>Why it exists</dt><dd>Useful cleanup should not require uploading personal photos or surrendering control.</dd></div></dl>
        <a href="/lifelens">Explore LifeLens <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="applyready-product" data-reveal>
      <div class="product-story applyready-story">
        <span class="product-status">Live web product</span>
        <h3>ApplyReady</h3>
        <p class="product-tagline">Better applications. Built on what you've actually done.</p>
        <dl><div><dt>The problem</dt><dd>Application tools often improve wording without showing whether the evidence is real.</dd></div><div><dt>What I built</dt><dd>Resume-to-role analysis that identifies evidence, gaps, and editable application material.</dd></div><div><dt>Why it exists</dt><dd>A stronger application should never require a more fictional applicant.</dd></div></dl>
        <a href="/applyready">Explore ApplyReady <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="applyready-surface"><img src="/applyready/fit.png" alt="ApplyReady role-fit analysis showing evidence and gaps" width="1200" height="1200" loading="eager" decoding="async" /></div>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section id="writing" class="writing dark-section" aria-labelledby="writing-title">
    <div class="writing-heading" data-reveal><p class="section-tag"><span>05</span> Writing</p><h2 id="writing-title">Notes from inside the system.</h2><a href="/writing">All writing <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></div>
    <div class="writing-list">
      <a href="/writing/reliability" data-reveal><span>Reliability</span><h3>Reliability is a product decision.</h3><b aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</b></a>
      <a href="/writing/improvement" data-reveal><span>Improvement</span><h3>Continuous improvement is a way of seeing.</h3><b aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</b></a>
      <a href="/writing/bounded-ai" data-reveal><span>Applied AI</span><h3>AI earns trust one bounded decision at a time.</h3><b aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</b></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="contact dark-section" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
    <div data-reveal><p class="section-tag">Contact</p><h2 id="contact-title">Systems worth improving.</h2><p>Technology, operations, AI, and the work of building them well.</p><nav aria-label="Contact links"><a href="/contact">Contact</a><a href={site.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn <span aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span></a><a href={site.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span></a><a href={site.resumeUrl}>Resume</a></nav></div>
  </section>

  <style>
    :global(body){background:#0b1220}.dark-section,.impact,.hero{padding-inline:var(--pad)}.dark-section{background:#0e1726;color:#aeb9c8}.chapter-label,.through-intro,.system-evolution,.impact-heading,.impact-list,.experience-intro,.career-track,.ai-intro,.ai-matrix,.built-heading,.lifelens-product,.applyready-product,.writing-heading,.writing-list,.contact>div{width:min(var(--max),100%);margin-inline:auto}.section-tag,.chapter-label,.role,.product-status,.phone-surface>span{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.64rem;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}.section-tag{color:#91a1b5}.section-tag span{color:#75b7fb;margin-right:12px}
    .hero{background:#0b1220;color:#fff;padding-top:clamp(58px,8vw,108px);overflow:hidden}.hero-inner{width:min(var(--max),100%);margin:auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.03fr .97fr;gap:clamp(40px,7vw,96px);align-items:center}.hero-copy{padding-bottom:70px}.identity{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:18px;margin-bottom:40px}.identity strong{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(1.45rem,2.2vw,1.9rem);color:#f5f3ed}.identity span,.role{color:#91a1b5}.identity span{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.62rem;text-transform:uppercase}.role{margin-bottom:22px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(3.4rem,6.4vw,6.25rem);line-height:.94;letter-spacing:-.045em;color:#f5f3ed;max-width:11ch}.hero h1 span{color:#8bbcf0}.hero-lead{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(1.03rem,1.55vw,1.25rem);line-height:1.58;color:#aeb9c8;max-width:39em;margin-top:34px}.topology{align-self:stretch;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;min-height:520px}.topology-labels{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:#8392a6;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.6rem;text-transform:uppercase}.topology svg{width:100%;height:auto;color:#607089}.topology .grid{opacity:.09}.topology .mesh{opacity:.55}.topology .nodes{fill:#8898ad}.topology .signals{stroke:#4d9aeb;stroke-dasharray:10 14;animation:signal 8s linear infinite}.topology .signals path:nth-child(2){animation-delay:-2s}.topology .signal-node,.topology .end-node{fill:#c6a15a}.topology .resolved{stroke:#c6a15a;stroke-dasharray:4 7;animation:signal 5s linear infinite}.topology text{fill:#91a1b5;font:11px var(--font-mono)}.topology>p{text-align:right;color:#8291a5;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.62rem}.proof-strip{width:min(var(--max),100%);margin:auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13)}.proof-strip div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:18px;align-items:start;min-height:126px;padding:27px 30px;border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13)}.proof-strip div:last-child{border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13)}.proof-strip dt{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:2.05rem;line-height:1;color:#f5f3ed;font-weight:700}.proof-strip dd{margin:0;color:#91a0b4;font-size:.77rem;line-height:1.45;max-width:21ch}@keyframes signal{to{stroke-dashoffset:-220}}
    .through-line{padding-top:clamp(86px,10vw,142px);padding-bottom:clamp(92px,11vw,154px);background:#0e1726;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06)}.chapter-label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-bottom:22px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13);color:#8291a5}.through-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:190px 1fr;gap:clamp(32px,7vw,98px);padding-top:58px}.through-intro>p{color:#c6a15a;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.65rem;text-transform:uppercase}.through-intro h2{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4.3vw,3.9rem);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.035em;color:#f5f3ed;max-width:15ch}.through-intro div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:42px;margin-top:30px;color:#9ba9ba;max-width:800px}.system-evolution{list-style:none;padding:0;margin-top:76px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14)}.system-evolution li{position:relative;min-height:190px;padding:25px 20px;border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);display:flex;flex-direction:column}.system-evolution li::after{content:"";position:absolute;right:-5px;top:32px;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#4d9aeb;z-index:1}.system-evolution li:last-child::after{right:20px;background:#c6a15a}.system-evolution span,.system-evolution small{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.59rem;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8291a5}.system-evolution strong{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.02rem;color:#e8edf3;margin-top:auto}.system-evolution small{margin-top:8px}
    .impact{background:#f2f0ea;color:#19263a;padding-top:clamp(88px,10vw,138px);padding-bottom:clamp(90px,10vw,140px)}.impact-heading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:190px 1fr;gap:clamp(32px,7vw,98px)}.impact .section-tag{color:#566579}.impact .section-tag span{color:#245f9f}.impact-heading h2{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,3.7vw,3.35rem);line-height:1.07;letter-spacing:-.03em;max-width:15ch}.impact-heading>p:last-child{grid-column:2;color:#5d6878;max-width:52ch}.impact-list{margin-top:68px;border-top:1px solid rgba(17,33,57,.18)}.impact-list article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:31% 1fr;gap:clamp(34px,6vw,82px);padding:42px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(17,33,57,.18)}.impact-name{display:flex;flex-direction:column}.impact-name span,.impact-list dt{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.61rem;text-transform:uppercase;color:#687487}.impact-name strong{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(1.55rem,2.8vw,2.5rem);line-height:1.05;margin-top:auto;color:#214f82;max-width:10ch}.impact-list dl{margin:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.impact-list dl div{padding:0 24px;border-left:1px solid rgba(17,33,57,.15)}.impact-list dd{margin:8px 0 0;color:#4e5b6d;font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.55}
    .experience{padding-top:clamp(94px,11vw,152px);padding-bottom:clamp(94px,11vw,152px);background:#101a2a}.experience-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:190px 1fr auto;gap:clamp(30px,6vw,80px);align-items:end}.experience-intro h2{color:#f3f1eb;font-size:clamp(2.15rem,3.5vw,3.15rem);letter-spacing:-.03em;max-width:16ch}.experience-intro a,.writing-heading a{color:#8fc3f7;font-weight:600;font-size:.82rem}.career-track{list-style:none;padding:0;margin-top:64px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14)}.career-track li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px 1fr;gap:42px;padding:25px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14)}.career-track time{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.65rem;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7fb8f3}.career-track div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:28px}.career-track strong{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.02rem;color:#e9edf3}.career-track span{color:#8493a7;font-size:.84rem}
    .ai{padding-top:clamp(88px,10vw,136px);padding-bottom:clamp(92px,10vw,142px);background:#0d1624;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06)}.ai-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:190px 1fr;gap:clamp(32px,7vw,98px)}.ai-intro>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:52px}.ai h2{color:#f3f1eb;font-size:clamp(2.25rem,3.8vw,3.45rem);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.035em}.ai-intro div>p{color:#9ba9ba;max-width:48ch}.ai-matrix{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);margin-top:66px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14)}.ai-matrix article{min-height:230px;padding:26px 22px;border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);display:flex;flex-direction:column}.ai-matrix span{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.6rem;color:#72b4f6}.ai-matrix h3{color:#e9edf3;font-size:1.05rem;margin-top:auto}.ai-matrix p{color:#8493a7;font-size:.83rem;margin:0}
